#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-options.rst:27 c6a5aba5c2324f109cf63cafe3f3ec0a
msgid ""
"for example, to set this option to ignore receiver failsafe bits, you would "
"set bit 2, or a value of \"4\" (2^2=4). This may be usefull when using "
"ground station control beyond the range of the RC system which can set its "
"receiver's outputs to trim values upon RC signal loss, but still has a "
"failsafe bit in the protocol which would otherwise force an RC failsafe to "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"例如，若要忽略接收机失控保护位，应将第 2 位置 1，即设置值为「4」（2^2=4）。当地面站控制范围超出 RC "
"系统范围时，接收机可能会将其输出设置为配平值并置位失控保护位，此时该选项可防止触发 RC 失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-options.rst:30 e30a1b07fe464553872c61f0aa608700
msgid ""
"There is also an :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` bitmask that can be used "
"to restrict which RC protocols are detected and used. This is useful in "
"cases where the RC protocol autodetection fails and an incorrect RC protocol"
" handler is chosen. This is rare, but if you do find it happens then you can"
" lock in a single RC protocol that can be detected and used with this "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"此外还有 :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` 位掩码，可用于限制所检测和使用的 RC 协议类型。当 RC "
"协议自动检测失败并选择了错误的协议处理器时，此参数非常有用。这种情况较为罕见，但若确实发生，可通过此参数锁定单一 RC 协议以确保正确检测和使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-options.rst:32 0388f25123704d27a924bd13f5c1b889
msgid ""
"Once ArduPilot decodes the RC protocol being used, it will send a message "
"declaring which protocol is being decoded to the Ground Control Station."
msgstr "ArduPilot 解码当前使用的 RC 协议后，将向地面站发送一条消息说明正在解码的协议。"
